{
 "_about": "MORDHAU weapons as Skyrim items. The plugin makes each at start from the first Skyrim weapon named in skyrim_like (its kind, sounds, perks and Skyrim model), gives it this name, damage, weight and value, and adds it to every levelled list that holds one of the skyrim_like weapons, at the same levels: so they turn up as loot, in shops and in the hands of bandits. Held, such an item IS its MORDHAU weapon (and is drawn as MORDHAU's model). Damage / weight / value are in Skyrim's terms, set here by MORDHAU's ranking of the weapons; not from either game's data. The items have fixed ids (0xFF7E1000 + row number): rows are only ever added at the end.",
